布AI代理全套开发工具链","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmph6k3uv0lqqsljwlwu0lr4z","https://x.com/GoogleAI/status/2057871583843135978"],"articles":[{"id":"cmph6k3uv0lqqsljwlwu0lr4z","title":"谷歌I/O大会发布AI代理全套开发工具链","originalTitle":"","summary":"谷歌在I/O开发者大会宣布，系统性构建面向AI代理（Agent）的开发与部署工具链。核心更新包括：独立桌面应用Antigravity 2.0及其命令行工具、SDK面世；Google AI Studio新增Kotlin支持，可一键开发安卓应用并发布，同时推出移动端App。此外，Gemini API推出托管代理服务，实现一键部署；WebMCP作为开放标准在Chrome 149中推出，允许网页向代理暴露工具；Chrome DevTools也开放给AI代理以自动化调试。企业级客户可直接连接Google Cloud项目，而DeepMind的科学技能包则加速特定领域研究。此举标志着谷歌正全面打造从开发、接口到部署的完整AI代理生态系统。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmph6k3uv0lqqsljwlwu0lr4z","originalUrl":"https://x.com/GoogleAI/status/2057871583843135978","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1cw0duh","originalSourceName":"X：Google AI (@GoogleAI)","family":"google","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmph6k3uv0lqqsljwlwu0lr4z","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1cw0duh","name":"X：Google AI (@GoogleAI)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z"}],"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","reportSummary":"谷歌在I/O开发者大会宣布，系统性构建面向AI代理（Agent）的开发与部署工具链。核心更新包括：独立桌面应用Antigravity 2.0及其命令行工具、SDK面世；Google AI Studio新增Kotlin支持，可一键开发安卓应用并发布，同时推出移动端App。此外，Gemini API推出托管代理服务，实现一键部署；WebMCP作为开放标准在Chrome 149中推出，允许网页向代理暴露工具；Chrome DevTools也开放给AI代理以自动