-1afsx4l","name":"GitHub Blog","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"Gartner 最新发布的魔力象限报告中，GitHub 连续第三年被列为“领导者”象限，该评估专注于企业级 AI 编程代理领域。GitHub 表示，其致力于构建一个开放、安全且由 AI 驱动的平台，以赋能每一位开发者并定义软件开发的未来。此次评选进一步巩固了 GitHub 在 AI 辅助开发工具市场的领先地位。","reportEdition":"2026-05-23","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmph3ld5o0l1rsljw8j7x2le7","title":"OpenAI被Gartner评为企业AI编码代理领域领导者","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmph3ld5o0l1rsljw8j7x2le7","https://openai.com/index/gartner-2026-agentic-coding-leader"],"articles":[{"id":"cmph3ld5o0l1rsljw8j7x2le7","title":"OpenAI被Gartner评为企业AI编码代理领域领导者","originalTitle":"","summary":"Gartner发布2026年企业AI编码代理魔力象限报告，OpenAI被列为领导者。其产品Codex因在技术创新和企业级部署方面的突出表现获得认可，反映了OpenAI在AI辅助编程工具领域的领先地位。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmph3ld5o0l1rsljw8j7x2le7","originalUrl":"https://openai.com/index/gartner-2026-agentic-coding-leader","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1wljf9q","originalSourceName":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","family":"openai","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmph3ld5o0l1rsljw8j7x2le7","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1wljf9q","name":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"Gartner发布2026年企业AI编码代理魔力象限报告，OpenAI被列为领导者。其产品Codex因在技术创新和企业级部署方面的突出表现获得认可，反映了OpenAI在AI辅助编程工具领域的领先地位。","reportEdition":"2026-05-23","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpga762r0dmfsljwzsp341eh","title":"图灵测试 76 年后首现 AI 通过实证：GPT-4.5 以 73% 判定率超越真人","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpga762r0dmfsljwzsp341eh","https://www.ithome.com/0/953/705.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmpga762r0dmfsljwzsp341eh","title":"图灵测试 76 年后首现 AI 通过实证：GPT-4.5 以 73% 判定率超越真人","originalTitle":"","summary":"加州大学圣地亚哥分校研究首次实证现代AI可通过图灵测试。研究表明，在获得特定提示后，GPT-4.5在5至15分钟的对话中被误认为人类的概率高达73%，显著超过真人。LLaMa-3.1-405B的判定率（56%）与真人相当，而GPT-4o和ELIZA仅约20%。研究指出提示词至关重要，它使AI能模仿人类语气、幽默感甚至易错性等社会行为特征。这一发现迫使人们重新思考图灵测试的意义，并凸显了大语言模型在网络信任与安全方面构成的潜在挑战。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpga762r0dmfsljwzsp341eh","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/953/705.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpga762r0dmfsljwzsp341eh","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"加州大学圣地亚哥分校研究首次实证现代AI可通过图灵测试。研究表明，在获得特定提示后，GPT-4.5在5至15分钟的对话中被误认为人类的概率高达73%，显著超过真人。LLaMa-3.1-405B的判定率（56%）与真人相当，而GPT-4o和ELIZA仅约20%。研究指出提示词至关重要，它使AI能模仿人类语气、幽默感甚至易错性等社会行为特征。这一发现迫使人们重新思考图灵测试的意义，并凸显了大语言模型在网络信任与安全方面构成的潜在挑战。","reportEdition":"2026-05-23","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmphirw6f0oqmsljw84zngzfo","title":"AlphaProof Nexus：用形式化验证驱动AI数学证明搜索","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmphirw6f0oqmsljw84zngzfo","https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2057954067146781151"],"articles":[{"id":"cmphirw6f0oqmsljw84zngzfo","title":"AlphaProof Nexus：用形式化验证驱动AI数学证明搜索","originalTitle":"","summary":"Google DeepMind提出了AlphaProof Nexus系统，它将大型语言模型与Lean形式化验证工具相结合。该系统允许LLM在生成证明的过程中，不断读取Lean的编译错误并进行修正，还可调用更强的工具辅助解决子问题。这一机制迫使模型将每一步逻辑都转化为可编译、可验证的代码，从而将其角色从“令人信服的叙述者”转变为“候选方案生成器”。在针对353个Erdős问题和492个开放猜想的测试中，系统成功解决了9个Erdős问题并证明了44个序列猜想。该研究展示了形式化验证在暴露AI逻辑错误、建立“人类提问-模型探索-验证器把关”新分工中的关键作用。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmphirw6f0oqmsljw84zngzfo","originalUrl":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2057954067146781151","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1sngkqe","originalSourceName":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","family":"outlet-1lanm2l","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmphirw6f0oqmsljw84zngzfo","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1sngkqe","name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Google DeepMind提出了AlphaProof Nexus系统，它将大型语言模型与Lean形式化验证工具相结合。该系统允许LLM在生成证明的过程中，不断读取Lean的编译错误并进行修正，还可调用更强的工具辅助解决子问题。这一机制迫使模型将每一步逻辑都转化为可编译、可验证的代码，从而将其角色从“令人信服的叙述者”转变为“候选方案生成器”。在针对353个Erdős问题和492个开放猜想的测试中，系统成功解决了9个Erdős问题并证明了44个序列猜想。该研究展示了形式化验证在暴露AI逻辑错误、建立“人类提问-模型探索-验证器把关”新分工中的关键作用。","reportEdition":"2026-05-23","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmph748qc0lwnsljwiu60grlt","title":"VSAS-Bench：视觉流式辅助模型的实时评估基准","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmph748qc0lwnsljwiu60grlt","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/vsas-bench-streaming-assistant"],"articles":[{"id":"cmph748qc0lwnsljwiu60grlt","title":"VSAS-Bench：视觉流式辅助模型的实时评估基准","originalTitle":"","summary":"现有视觉语言模型框架主要在离线场景下评估性能，但实时视觉助手所依赖的流式模型还需考量额外指标，如反映响应时效性的“主动性”和捕捉随时间推移响应稳定性的“一致性”。为此，研究团队提出了VSAS-Bench，这是一个新的评估基准，专门针对流式视觉语言模型在实时交互任务中的表现，填补了当前评估方法在动态、持续生成场景下的空白。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmph748qc0lwnsljwiu60grlt","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/vsas-bench-streaming-assistant","publishedAt":"2026-05-23T00:00:00.443Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmph748qc0lwnsljwiu60grlt","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-12T08:49:11.438Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple 